From 71fab797f239e938847708c2dccb60bfc3c56428 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 09:17:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Draw incidents a framing page sends, with two-way
 selection

A page that frames GEV (JARVIS) can send a bounded list of incidents
(id, position, kind, severity, evidence, title) over postMessage. GEV
draws one point per id, reports clicks back, flies to a selection on
request and returns home. Messages are accepted only from the framing
origin, validated and capped; nothing is followed as an instruction.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WPPSXQnG7RfZ1xugyYTx5K
